Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:22:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] xbox elite paddles

Expose Xbox Elite grip controls only for the supported Microsoft identities,
with transition and generic-device isolation tests. The Rust API is unchanged.
Reconstructed from the existing Pyroshine vendor change through 3c44293.
---
